Aim:-
a. Write Program to Load, Clean and Exploring the data using python.

Algorithm:_
1. Start
2. Import pandas library as pd
3. Create a dictionary with Name, Marks, and Age
4. Convert the dictionary into a DataFrame (df)
5. Display original data and first 5 rows (head())
6. Show data information using df.info()
7. Check missing values using df.isnull().sum()
8. Remove missing values using df.dropna() → store in df_clean
9. Display cleaned data
10. Display summary statistics using df_clean.describe()
11. Stop

Code:-
import pandas as pd

data = {
    "Name": ["A", "B", "C", "D", "E"],
    "Marks": [80, 75, None, 90, 85],
    "Age": [20, 21, 19, None, 22]
}

df = pd.DataFrame(data)

print("Original Data:")
print(df)

print("\nFirst 5 rows:")
print(df.head())

print("\nData Info:")
print(df.info())

print("\nMissing values:")
print(df.isnull().sum())

df_clean = df.dropna()

print("\nCleaned Data:")
print(df_clean)

print("\nSummary statistics:")
print(df_clean.describe())

